  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "round-heads-sahara-s057-p00617",
      "source_en": "In the course of recent years many paintings have almost or completely disappeared due to the irresponsible behaviour of tourists and their guides. Hopefully, awareness will be raised not only among the local Algerian and Libyan populations living near to the painted sites, but also among the local academics and institutes who underestimate greatly their archaeological Conclusion 157 heritage. It is a paradox that scholars from Europe are rather inhibited in the research by local authorities, whereas the Algerian and Libyan scholars show little interest in the rock art.",
